IS
    '期数';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.REPORTTYPE
IS
    '报表类型：PROD-产品，BALANCE-资产负债表，DEPOSIT-结构性存款';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.PROPERTYCODE
IS
    '属性代码';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.NEW_BALANCE
IS
    '新产品余额';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.NEW_TERMS
IS
    '新产品加权价格/剩余期限';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.OLD_BALANCE
IS
    '老产品余额';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.OLD_TERMS
IS
    '老产品加权价格/剩余期限';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.ORG_CODE
IS
    '机构代码';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.DEPT_CODE
IS
    '部门代码';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CHB_TRANS_MONTH_DETAIL.REPORTUUID
IS
    '月报主表主键';

